          <td>
            <table width="690" border="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="1">
              <tr>
                <td class="headline" align="center" height="30" colspan="3">Big Game Hunt Rules</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
								<td>
								  <ol>
                    <li>2 buttons should be created.  /assist &lt;MAIN&gt; /assist &lt;SECOND&gt;  These
                        are necessary or you will get your ass chewed by enchanters.</li>
                    <li>Concentrate on the red spam that goes through.  If the /assist changes they will 
                        'Hail &lt;NEW MoB&gt;'.  Example Hate, Spite Golems hurt and are almost 100% unmezzable.</li>
                    <li>Watch out for the Cleric /camp command.  If that goes up the raid is going fubar and you 
                        have to protect the cleric at all costs to get them camped.  Once that has happened 
                        sit/stand there and die (Don't run around).</li>
                    <li>Evac'ing will get you thrown off the raid, as will gate.</li>
                    <li>There is always a master looter.</li>
                    <li>If your group get a kill one person loots and calls out the loot in /shout (or /ooc sometimes).</li>
                    <li>Loot is randomed by a set person  (Loot Master).  This person will /shout 'Who wants in the roll 
                        for uber_weapon_01'.  You then /tell them and they will add you.</li>
                    <li>You should always be set to query of no drop pick up.  (A God send of an option).</li>
                    <li>There are certain things you do and don't do on raids.  I've not been on a 
                        fear (break in) raid so I can't comment, but these are a few Do's and Dont's of Hate.
                        <ul>
                          <li>Don't sit near walls.</li>
                          <li>Don't /shout (use /ooc to berate other people on raid).</li>
                          <li>Don't stand near the archway.</li>
                          <li>Don't sit on the zone in point (Agro point).</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>Have Fun</li>
                  </ol>
								</td>
							</tr>
            </table>
